## Introduction
In this section, we introduce the dataset and the objectives of the analysis. We will explore the sales data to uncover patterns and actionable insights.

## Data Import
```python
import pandas as pd

# Load the data
sales_data = pd.read_csv('sales_data.csv')
```

## Data Cleaning
In this section, we will clean the data by handling missing values and correcting data types.

```python
# Handle missing values
sales_data.fillna(0, inplace=True)

# Convert date column to datetime
sales_data['order_date'] = pd.to_datetime(sales_data['order_date'])
```

## Exploratory Data Analysis
Here, we will perform various analyses to visualize sales trends and customer behaviors.

```python
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
import seaborn as sns

# Sales trend over time
plt.figure(figsize=(12, 6))
sns.lineplot(data=sales_data, x='order_date', y='sales')
plt.title('Sales Trend Over Time')
plt.xlabel('Date')
plt.ylabel('Sales')
plt.show()
```

